{"canonical_record":{"canonical_payload_sha256":"22b8b8b1e2ad22238ec30876c2d9ae1d949f6e8814da6d3a7866700fad5beab2","full_review_record_id":"fullrev_b66f0bad520b66a7039047e34a346225f50ca00b14c9362b219e0b79084c2aee","overall_assessment":"The paper is well-organized and clearly written, with a logical progression from the probabilistic interpretation of CCA to the proposed VCCA and VCCA-private models. The mathematical derivations are rigorous and the notation is consistent, facilitating a strong understanding of the theoretical contributions. The experimental section is detailed, providing sufficient information for reproducibility, including dataset descriptions, model architectures, and hyperparameter settings. The use of figures and tables is effective in illustrating the model's behavior and results, with captions that are informative and aligned with the text.","paper_id":"H1Heentlx","paper_identity_sha256":"aa14c81f8d92981346a6d974f5edae5e89a8f1b73cb5687f39e6f23ba4d712cd","prompt_identity_sha256":"37c59160860a90c1274d29896125d5a87ddaed5d108fc2b1064ab2349dff6c5a","raw_response_sha256":"5a011130ac84c57658143c8dc26bab9b2feca674a97f5a9b9c0d3ad936339637","request_identity_sha256":"4064e8f75c7ac0bb1ad5d97f4f53424abde324832e057307a7be30acfca45c00","reviewer_identity_sha256":"c1cd7c7fdd4a2cbeb45c2f21af982ad0f30bffae8ae148e3eba36479685cf360","role":"CLAR","schema_version":"agentreview-full-review-corpus-v4","structural_context_sha256":"b821e43be712e80f9ef8a1c1bd694e1cef6c4afedb10f9131936b7e1cfdffab5","subdimension_sections":[{"paper_anchor_ids":["SRC-001","SRC-002","SRC-003","SRC-004","SRC-005","SRC-006","SRC-007","SRC-008","SRC-009","SRC-010","SRC-011","SRC-012","SRC-013","SRC-014","SRC-015","SRC-016","SRC-017","SRC-018","SRC-019","SRC-020","SRC-021","SRC-022","SRC-023","SRC-024","SRC-025","SRC-026","SRC-027","SRC-028","SRC-029","SRC-030","SRC-031","SRC-032","SRC-033","SRC-034","SRC-035","SRC-036","SRC-037","SRC-038","SRC-039","SRC-040"],"review_text":"The paper is well-structured, with a clear narrative flow from the introduction of the problem to the proposed solution and its evaluation. The terminology is precise, and key concepts such as 'common variables' and 'private variables' are clearly defined and consistently used throughout the text. The algorithmic presentation is thorough, with the VCCA and VCCA-private models described in detail, including the derivation of the variational lower bound and the optimization procedure. The use of equations and pseudocode-like descriptions (e.g., the reparameterization trick) is clear and easy to follow. The paper effectively communicates the motivation, methodology, and results, making it accessible to an expert reader.","subdimension_id":"CLAR-WRT"},{"paper_anchor_ids":["SRC-009","SRC-010","SRC-011","SRC-012","SRC-013","SRC-014","SRC-015","SRC-016","SRC-017","SRC-018","SRC-020","SRC-021","SRC-022","SRC-023","SRC-024"],"review_text":"The mathematical notation is consistent and well-defined. The paper introduces the probabilistic model for CCA and extends it to the VCCA framework with clear definitions of the latent variables, observation models, and variational approximations. The derivations of the variational lower bound and the KL divergence terms are step-by-step and easy to follow. The notation for the VCCA-private model is also clear, with distinct symbols for the common and private variables. The use of equations is appropriate, and the mathematical explanations are sufficient for an expert reader to understand the model's mechanics and the optimization process.","subdimension_id":"CLAR-NOT"},{"paper_anchor_ids":["SRC-005","SRC-029","SRC-034","SRC-036","SRC-038","SRC-039","SRC-040"],"review_text":"The figures and tables are well-integrated into the text, with captions that provide sufficient context for understanding the visual content. Figure 1 clearly illustrates the probabilistic interpretation of CCA, and Figure 2 provides a schematic of the VCCA model. The t-SNE embeddings 